      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Right now I can only suggest skipping calibration. You can still skip the calibration by opening the steamvr dashboard. Hit calibrate then quickly open up steamvr. You can then safely enter back into the game when your avatar has loaded. If you see tracker items still visible floating from the calibration just open and close any in game menu screen to hide them.",
